revoke.t.sol
├── given the subscription is not registered
│   └── it should revert with the {SubscriptionNotActive} error
└── given the subscription is registered
    ├── given the subscription is already revoked
    │   └── it should revert with the {SubscriptionRevoked} error
    └── given the subscription is not revoked
        ├── when the caller is not the subscription {Space}
        │   └── it should revert with the {OnlySubscriptionSpace} error
        └── when the caller is the subscription {Space}
            ├── it should mark the subscription as revoked
            ├── it should emit the {Revoked} event
            └── it should prevent any further charge
